{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-lucky-royale-residence","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"lucky-royale-residence-lucky-aeon-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","about":"Lucky Royale Residences is a 15-storey project by Lucky Aeon in the heart of Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC) consisting of studios, 1-3 bedroom apartments and 3-4 bedroom Sky Villas. This premier residential project redefines luxury living through a harmonious blend of contemporary architecture and luxurious amenities. A total of 146 apartments are thoughtfully designed to maximize space, light and comfort, ensuring each resident enjoys a tranquil and stylish home environment. All residences feature floor-to-ceiling windows and private terraces, offering spectacular views of the Dubai skyline and surrounding lush landscapes. The interiors are adorned with high quality finishes and modern furnishings. Every detail, from state-of-the-art security systems to stylish wall finishes, has been thoughtfully designed to ensure a luxurious living experience. The residences are equipped with smart home systems.Residents of Lucky Royale Residence have access to the following services and amenities: private swimming pools, rooftop infinity pool, podium roof gardens, rooftop lounge area, barbecue area, children's play areas, fitness studio, yoga area, library, co-working space, prayer room.The complex is located inside the central part of the JVC neighborhood in Dubai. The neighborhood is known for its green and landscaped infrastructure, including parks and recreational areas, with easy access to major roads, making it easy to get around the city.","price":1450000,"title":"Lucky Royale Residence","bitrix":{"id":738,"pf_id":"are.2.13771","source":null,"project_id":"Lucky Royale Residence","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Lucky Royale Residence","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Lucky Aeon","project_location":"Jumeir